          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said unto Moses, Now shalt thou see what I will do to Pharaoh: for with a strong hand shall he let them go, and with a strong hand shall he drive them out of his land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And God spake unto Moses, and said unto him, I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ":",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I appeared unto Abraham, unto Isaac, and unto Jacob, by",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "the name of",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God Almighty, but by my name",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "JEHOVAH",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "was I not known to them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I have also established my covenant with them, to give them the land of Canaan, the land of their pilgrimage, wherein they were strangers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I have also heard the groaning of the children of Israel, whom the Egyptians keep in bondage; and I have remembered my covenant.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore say unto the children of Israel, I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and I will bring you out from under the burdens of the Egyptians, and I will rid you out of their bondage, and I will redeem you with a stretched out arm, and with great judgments:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will take you to me for a people, and I will be to you a God: and ye shall know that I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God, which bringeth you out from under the burdens of the Egyptians.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will bring you in unto the land, concerning the which I did swear to give it to Abraham, to Isaac, and to Jacob; and I will give it you for an heritage: I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And Moses spake so unto the children of Israel: but they hearkened not unto Moses for anguish of spirit, and for cruel bondage.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spake unto Moses, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go in, speak unto Pharaoh king of Egypt, that he let the children of Israel go out of his land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses spake before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", saying, Behold, the children of Israel have not hearkened unto me; how then shall Pharaoh hear me, who",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of uncircumcised lips?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spake unto Moses and unto Aaron, and gave them a charge unto the children of Israel, and unto Pharaoh king of Egypt, to bring the children of Israel out of the land of Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ These",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the heads of their fathers' houses: The sons of Reuben the firstborn of Israel; Hanoch, and Pallu, Hezron, and Carmi: these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the families of Reuben.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Simeon; Jemuel, and Jamin, and Ohad, and Jachin, and Zohar, and Shaul the son of a Canaanitish woman: these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the families of Simeon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the names of the sons of Levi according to their generations; Gershon, and Kohath, and Merari: and the years of the life of Levi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an hundred thirty and seven years.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.16"
            ]
          }
